{"id":"ae3e412a-ac65-4b8a-997c-495093e924b9","revision":0,"last_node_id":49,"last_link_id":64,"nodes":[{"id":2,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[3834.103455471608,1273.6516236909893],"size":[502.5545445112707,889.0493890535145],"flags":{},"order":1,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"HOW TO USE","properties":{},"widgets_values":["## Usage\n\nThis workflow is designed to make generating images with Anima easier by combining a structured prompt system, an LLM-assisted prompt builder, and optional upscaling. Start by describing what you want to create in simple terms. You can use the included LLM prompt instructions with any chat-based LLM: paste the instructions, describe your idea, and the LLM will generate organized prompt sections such as character, appearance, pose, expression, clothing, camera, lighting, background, and effects. These sections can then be copied into the Anima Prompt Parser.\n\nThe Anima Prompt Parser is a helper tool that organizes your generated prompt sections into the correct input fields. After pasting the LLM output into the parser, press Sync All to automatically populate all individual prompt boxes. The individual prompt boxes are the main inputs used by the workflow for image generation. The parser itself does not generate images and does not execute any generation logic; it only helps organize and transfer prompt information.\n\nIf you only want to update one specific section, you can use Sync This Slot on the relevant parser text box. For example, if you only want to change the pose, paste a new pose description into the pose parser slot and press Sync This Slot to update only that section without changing the rest of the prompt.\n"],"color":"#222","bgcolor":"#000"},{"id":3,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[4375.498523400152,1267.7060316554634],"size":[670,929.34375],"flags":{},"order":2,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"LLM Helper prompt","properties":{},"widgets_values":["You are an expert prompt writer for the Anima text-to-image model.\n\nYour job is to convert a user's request into prompt blocks for the following preset:\n\nQuality\nCharacter and Series\nAppearance\nPose\nExpression\nClothing\nCamera\nLighting\nBackground\nEffects\n\nRules:\n\n- Output ONLY the blocks below.\n- Do not explain your choices.\n- Do not write a complete paragraph.\n- Use comma-separated Danbooru/Gelbooru style tags where possible.\n- Use natural language only when a suitable tag does not exist.\n- Keep tags concise.\n- Do not repeat information across blocks.\n- Character identity belongs only in Character and Series.\n- Physical traits belong only in Appearance.\n- Clothing belongs only in Clothing.\n- Body position and actions belong only in Pose.\n- Facial emotion belongs only in Expression.\n- Camera framing and angle belong only in Camera.\n- Environment belongs only in Background.\n- Lighting belongs only in Lighting.\n- Visual enhancements belong only in Effects.\n- If the user does not specify something, infer a sensible default that matches the character and scene.\n- Do not include negative prompts.\n- Do not include markdown or code blocks.\n\nOutput format:\n\nQuality:\n...\n\nCharacter and Series:\n...\n\nAppearance:\n...\n\nPose:\n...\n\nExpression:\n...\n\nClothing:\n...\n\nCamera:\n...\n\nLighting:\n...\n\nBackground:\n...\n\nEffects:\n...\n\nExample:\n\nUser:\nFern from Frieren sitting inside a tavern drinking beer.\n\nAssistant:\n\nQuality:\nmasterpiece, best quality, safe\n\nCharacter and Series:\n1girl, Fern, Sousou no Frieren\n\nAppearance:\nlong purple hair, purple eyes, fair skin\n\nPose:\nsitting, holding mug, drinking, looking at viewer\n\nExpression:\ngentle smile, relaxed\n\nClothing:\nblack coat, white dress, puffy sleeves\n\nCamera:\nmedium shot, eye level\n\nLighting:\nwarm candlelight, soft lighting\n\nBackground:\nmedieval tavern, wooden tables, wooden barrels, patrons, fireplace\n\nEffects:\nvolumetric lighting, depth of field, ambient glow"],"color":"#222","bgcolor":"#000"},{"id":4,"type":"IkkiPromptParser","pos":[5245.758254577095,1332.9951411407087],"size":[400.98497326758024,457.47550895356335],"flags":{},"order":3,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"text","name":"text","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"text"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"QUALITY","name":"QUALITY","type":"STRING","links":[]},{"localized_name":"CHARACTER_AND_SERIES","name":"CHARACTER_AND_SERIES","type":"STRING","links":[]},{"localized_name":"APPEARANCE","name":"APPEARANCE","type":"STRING","links":[]},{"localized_name":"POSE","name":"POSE","type":"STRING","links":[]},{"localized_name":"EXPRESSION","name":"EXPRESSION","type":"STRING","links":[]},{"localized_name":"CLOTHING","name":"CLOTHING","type":"STRING","links":[]},{"localized_name":"CAMERA","name":"CAMERA","type":"STRING","links":[]},{"localized_name":"LIGHTING","name":"LIGHTING","type":"STRING","links":[]},{"localized_name":"BACKGROUND","name":"BACKGROUND","type":"STRING","links":[]},{"localized_name":"EFFECTS","name":"EFFECTS","type":"STRING","links":[]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"IkkiPromptParser"},"widgets_values":["Quality: masterpiece, best quality, safe\n\nCharacter and Series: 1girl, Fern, Sousou no Frieren\n\nAppearance: long purple hair, purple eyes, fair skin\n\nPose: sitting, holding mug, drinking, looking at viewer\n\nExpression: gentle smile, relaxed\n\nClothing: black coat, white dress, puffy sleeves\n\nCamera: medium shot, eye level\n\nLighting: warm candlelight, soft lighting\n\nBackground: medieval tavern, wooden tables, wooden barrels, patrons, fireplace\n\nEffects: volumetric lighting, depth of field, ambient glow",null]},{"id":16,"type":"UNETLoader","pos":[3163.256243093424,4036.9681558163225],"size":[310,130],"flags":{},"order":4,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"unet_name","name":"unet_name","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"unet_name"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"weight_dtype","name":"weight_dtype","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"weight_dtype"},"link":nul